default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Never packed a boot.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Never_packed_a_boot..png/revision/latest?cb=20231110002340\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Never packed a boot.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Never_packed_a_boot..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231110002340\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Never_packed_a_boot..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231110002340 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/78/Never_packed_a_boot..png/revision/latest?cb=20231110002340 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Never packed a boot.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Never_packed_a_boot..png\" data-image-name=\"Never packed a boot..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\">Susan Wokoma</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/I%27m_off_to_find_a_robin.\" title=\"I&#39;m off to find a robin.\">I'm off to find a robin.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fagin_at_the_disco.\" title=\"Fagin at the disco.\">Fagin at the disco.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Never packed a boot.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 9 November 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\">Susan Wokoma</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\">Lucy Beaumont</a> mentions that she’s also \"never packed a boot\", after explaining to Greg during the <a href=\"/wiki/Complete_the_fortune_trail\" title=\"Complete the fortune trail\">Complete the fortune trail</a> task that the reason she is so bad at coin-flipping is because there has always been a man around to do it. The title card displays a task envelope, but with a question mark instead of the 'TM' logo, which references the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_secret_task\" title=\"Find the secret task\">Find the secret task</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En ole koskaan pakannut autoa', which translates as 'I've never packed a car'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Aldrig packat en sko', which translates as 'Never packed a shoe', a clear mistranslation.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_single-word_object_you_own_and_love_that_gets_the_best_reaction_when_introduced_following_a_drum_roll\" title=\"Best single-word object you own and love that gets the best reaction when introduced following a drum roll\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best single-word object you own and love that gets the best reaction when introduced following a drum roll.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_secret_task\" title=\"Find the secret task\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>This is not a team task. Find the secret task. You must never be in the same room as each other. Whenever the air horn sounds, you must replace anything you are holding and change rooms. Everyone must find the secret task before the task ends.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>1</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">-1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>This is the secret task. If you found this task fastest, you must choose one contestant who will lose five points. If you found it second fastest, you must choose one contestant who will lose one point. If you found it third fastest, you must choose one contestant who will get a special hat. If you found it fourth fastest, you must choose a contestant who will gain a point. If you found it slowest, you must choose one contestant who will gain five points. You must not choose yourself. You must shout the name of your contestant in 10 seconds from now.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Complete_the_fortune_trail\" title=\"Complete the fortune trail\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Complete the fortune trail.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Convince_a_child_you%27re_asleep\" title=\"Convince a child you&#39;re asleep\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Convince a child you're asleep. You must either have a nap lasting one minute with your face visible throughout - during this nap, you must snore and sleepwalk - or you must have a nap lasting one minute where you are not in bed at all, but the child thinks you are. During this nap, you must snore and sleeptalk.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mime_the_proverb_on_your_card\" title=\"Mime the proverb on your card\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Mime the proverb on your card. There will be three minute-long rounds. You must be waving at each other throughout your attempt, but you can make a single noise of the Taskmaster's choosing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>11\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Never_packed_a_boot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/never-packed-boot\"><i>Never packed a boot.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>Never packed a boot.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920123934\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 834/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25786/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 170/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800541/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.381      1 -total\n 47.16%   29.890      1 Template:Spoilers\n 45.07%   28.565      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.98%   16.469      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 21.54%   13.651      1 Template:Episodes\n 12.68%    8.039     10 Template:Link\n  2.31%    1.464      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.23%    1.416      1 Template:Clear\n  2.09%    1.326      5 Template:Color\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:4017-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920123934 and revision id 43850. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}}}